 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Invertible object",
 "statement": "An invertible object of $D(X_{\\Proet},\\mathcal O_E/\\varpi^n)$ is a triple $(L,L',e)$ consisting of objects $L,L'$ and an isomorphism $e:L\\otimes^L_{\\mathcal O_E/\\varpi^n}L'\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(\\mathcal O_E/\\varpi^n)_X$. One says that $L$ is invertible if such $L',e$ exist. The same definition is made in $D(X_{\\Et},\\mathcal O_E/\\varpi^n)$.",
